{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/781525-i-just-want-to-see-sunlight-again","id":781525,"title":"\" I just want to see sunlight again\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-06T20:58:39-08:00","id":781525,"title":"\" I just want to see sunlight again\"","content":"Question: if a demon found a supernatural being who didn't want to be a supernatural being, and was willing to pay the bargain for becoming fully human...<br /> <br /> Could the demon deliver?<br /> <br /> Obviously not with a Pact, a demon can manipulate finances, social circumstances and genetic potential of an individual, but demonic exploits are pretty spiffy, up to an including raising the dead, and there is always the possibility of hijacking a piece of Infrastructure or a Facility.<br /> <br /> Any thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-07T05:35:54-08:00","id":781665,"title":"","content":"Depends on how flexible some Embeds, Exploits, and the Gadgets derived thereof are. I could see a set of Going Native, and Reality Enforcement Gadgets that might work to surpress someone's &quot;mojo&quot;. Maybe add in the social modifier Embeds to &quot;quick start&quot; someone into mortal life (for the ancient Vampires, Mummies, and like creatures).<br /> <br /> Of course, nothing says the Demon couldn't &quot;say&quot; they can make the rube human and sell them a Soul Pact. As far as their associates are concerned, the Demon appears to make good on it: [Supernatural] being gets replaced with them as a human (the Demon just needs to keep up that Cover).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-07T07:22:21-08:00","id":781690,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/781525-i-just-want-to-see-sunlight-again?p=781665#post781665\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Of course, nothing says the Demon couldn't &quot;say&quot; they can make the rube human and sell them a Soul Pact. As far as their associates are concerned, the Demon appears to make good on it: [Supernatural] being gets replaced with them as a human (the Demon just needs to keep up that Cover).</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, but at that point I want to say that the <i>demon</i> is the rube: they're left with a Cover with strong ties to the supernatural, possibly with friends who will now severely question how they got rid of their &quot;curse&quot; (or blessing, or birthright, or whatever).<br /> <br /> Just saying, the former supernatural cover seems like good fodder for Going Loud....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-07T09:33:01-08:00","id":781729,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BigDamnHero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/781525-i-just-want-to-see-sunlight-again?p=781690#post781690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sure, but at that point I want to say that the <i>demon</i> is the rube: they're left with a Cover with strong ties to the supernatural, possibly with friends who will now severely question how they got rid of their &quot;curse&quot; (or blessing, or birthright, or whatever).<br /> <br /> Just saying, the former supernatural cover seems like good fodder for Going Loud....</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Who sad the con had to be long term? Actually, since we are talking about a fairly significant change here, the Demon has quite a bit of leeway for arguing away all sorts of inconsistencies. They <b>are</b> experts at faking humanity. And that is what the supernatural now is. Their buddies want details on how to repeat the process? &quot;I had to make a deal. But, hey, I may know someone else who can help you make the same one.&quot; (Cue Ring-mate or alternate Cover)<br /> <br /> After all, the original question was &quot;could the Demon deliver on making a supernatural human&quot;. And this is a way... from a certain point of view.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 12-07-2015, 12:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-07T10:09:58-08:00","id":781740,"title":"","content":"Meanwhile the Prince orders a blood hunt because having vampires who can walk around in the sun points to strix and unsettles the entire court. Suddenly the one time you can expect to be safe from your rivals is safe no longer.<br /> <br /> I wouldn't say it's impossible, there's already an example of a vampire who made a deal with a demon to walk through the sun. But he's aware that if anyone else found out they'd kill first, ask questions afterwards with magic over his ashes.<br /> <br /> As for OP's question, there do seem to be some drastic ways to strip a character of their template, the demon might have to pull in some favors. There's a resurrection numina that allows it, though it requires a characters death and specifically can't be used on vampires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}